  /* Resumen intro (focal point last, prototype only): hero figures count over 1.6 s with a 5px blur (chAnim intro), the chart is revealed by a left-to-right wipe (ease-in-out, 1.5 s) and its dots pop on the spring 110 ms apart, the 20-segment bars are revealed by ONE clip wipe (ease-out, 1.5 s) over a grey base */
  /* One light sweep (DS .btn-v2--shine) across "Que estudiemos tu caso" after the Resumen intro lands (~2.1 s): the single next step we want to point to, once per arrival, never looping. The class is removed when the sweep ends, so later repaints do not replay it */
