    /* v149 grade letters: a soft wave, left to right. The dim letters rise 10px and sharpen from an 8px blur (800 ms, 70 ms apart), "Ahora" follows the wave 200 ms later, then the new grade lands last on the spring from 60% with a ring that opens around it; its caption rises in after it. No overshoot except the new grade. */
